            "content_html": "<div>\n<style>\n.mwk-project {\n    width: 100%;\n    max-width: 1100px;\n    margin: 25px auto;\n    color: #d0cec9;\n    font-family: 'DM Sans', sans-serif;\n    line-height: 1.7;\n}\n.mwk-episode {\n    width: 100%;\n    margin: 30px auto 42px;\n}\n.mwk-episode-details {\n    max-width: 900px;\n    padding-bottom: 18px;\n}\n.mwk-episode-details h2 {\n    font-family: 'Google Sans Flex', sans-serif;\n    font-size: 25px;\n    font-weight: 600;\n    color: #f5f1e9;\n    margin: 0 0 10px;\n}\n.mwk-episode-details p,\n.mwk-project p {\n    font-size: 15px;\n    margin: 0 0 18px;\n}\n.mwk-episode-video {\n    width: 100%;\n    container-type: inline-size;\n    background: #000;\n    border-radius: 6px;\n}\n.mwk-episode-video iframe {\n    display: block;\n    width: 100%;\n    height: calc(75cqw + 24px);\n    border: 0;\n    border-radius: 6px;\n}\n.mwk-divider {\n    width: 100%;\n    height: 1px;\n    background: rgba(200,173,130,0.2);\n    margin: 38px 0;\n}\n.mwk-content {\n    max-width: 900px;\n    margin: 45px auto 0;\n}\n.mwk-content h3 {\n    font-family: 'Google Sans Flex', sans-serif;\n    font-size: 12px;\n    font-weight: 600;\n    letter-spacing: 1.5px;\n    text-transform: uppercase;\n    color: #c8ad82;\n    margin: 30px 0 14px;\n}\n.mwk-content ul {\n    padding-left: 20px;\n    margin: 0 0 24px;\n}\n.mwk-content li {\n    font-size: 14px;\n    color: #e0ddd7;\n    margin-bottom: 9px;\n}\n.mwk-role {\n    margin-top: 30px !important;\n    padding-top: 20px;\n    border-top: 1px solid rgba(200,173,130,0.25);\n    color: #aaa69e;\n    font-size: 14px !important;\n}\n@media (max-width: 600px) {\n    .mwk-episode-details h2 {\n        font-size: 22px;\n    }\n}\n</style>\n\n<div class=\"mwk-project\">\n\n    <!-- EPISODE 1 -->\n    <div class=\"mwk-episode\">\n\n        <div class=\"mwk-episode-details\">\n            <h2>Episode 1 – Swiggy Food Delivery</h2>\n            <p>\n                Exploring the process of becoming a Swiggy food delivery partner, taking viewers through the practical steps involved and the experience of entering the delivery workforce.\n            </p>\n        </div>\n\n        <div class=\"mwk-episode-video\">\n            <div class=\"post__iframe\"><iframe loading=\"lazy\"                 src=\"https://drive.google.com/file/d/1JptimovDE-pAC2EaREeGd9hplt9aUlQs/preview\"\n                width=\"640\"\n                height=\"480\"\n                allow=\"autoplay\"\n                allowfullscreen>\n            </iframe></div>\n        </div>\n\n    </div>\n\n    <div class=\"mwk-divider\"></div>\n\n    <!-- EPISODE 2 -->\n    <div class=\"mwk-episode\">\n\n        <div class=\"mwk-episode-details\">\n            <h2>Episode 2 – Swiggy Instamart Delivery</h2>\n            <p>\n                A practical look at grocery delivery through Instamart, exploring dark stores, delivery shifts and the experiences of women working as Instamart delivery partners.\n            </p>\n        </div>\n\n        <div class=\"mwk-episode-video\">\n            <div class=\"post__iframe\"><iframe loading=\"lazy\"                 src=\"https://drive.google.com/file/d/1Fwe3lEUkYQcMAChJlYFmhK_LKHIQtUWs/preview\"\n                width=\"640\"\n                height=\"480\"\n                allow=\"autoplay\"\n                allowfullscreen>\n            </iframe></div>\n        </div>\n\n    </div>\n\n    <div class=\"mwk-divider\"></div>\n\n    <!-- EPISODE 3 -->\n    <div class=\"mwk-episode\">\n\n        <div class=\"mwk-episode-details\">\n            <h2>Episode 3 – Rapido Captain</h2>\n            <p>\n                Exploring the Rapido Captain registration process and the experiences of women working in bike and scooter-based passenger and delivery services.\n            </p>\n        </div>\n\n        <div class=\"mwk-episode-video\">\n            <div class=\"post__iframe\"><iframe loading=\"lazy\"                 src=\"https://drive.google.com/file/d/1h2KL5ONBu-BAmEpwGDE0fdykNMJy9dJD/preview\"\n                width=\"640\"\n                height=\"480\"\n                allow=\"autoplay\"\n                allowfullscreen>\n            </iframe></div>\n        </div>\n\n    </div>\n\n    <div class=\"mwk-divider\"></div>\n\n    <!-- EPISODE 4 -->\n    <div class=\"mwk-episode\">\n\n        <div class=\"mwk-episode-details\">\n            <h2>Episode 4 – DeHaat Village Representatives</h2>\n            <p>\n                Set in Tappal, Aligarh, this episode explores the work of women Village Representatives associated with DeHaat and their role in connecting farmers with agricultural services.\n            </p>\n        </div>\n\n        <div class=\"mwk-episode-video\">\n            <div class=\"post__iframe\"><iframe loading=\"lazy\"                 src=\"https://drive.google.com/file/d/1WbxJWg5AZvgx7SfcEoqWpZ_f8ZlsrqmW/preview\"\n                width=\"640\"\n                height=\"480\"\n                allow=\"autoplay\"\n                allowfullscreen>\n            </iframe></div>\n        </div>\n\n    </div>\n\n    <!-- SEPARATOR AFTER EPISODE 4 -->\n    <div class=\"mwk-divider\"></div>\n\n    <!-- PROJECT OVERVIEW AND CONTRIBUTION -->\n    <div class=\"mwk-content\">\n\n        <p>\n            Mardon Wale Kaam is an Aatm Nirbhar content series exploring professions traditionally perceived as men's work. Through real-world experiences and conversations with women already working in these roles, the series challenges assumptions about women's participation in different professions.\n        </p>\n\n        <p>\n            The project extended beyond individual YouTube episodes into a broader content and awareness initiative, with a distribution approach designed to take these stories beyond YouTube and reach relevant audiences.\n        </p>\n\n        <h3>CONTENT STRATEGY & CAMPAIGN PLANNING</h3>\n        <ul>\n            <li>Developing the content approach around experience-led storytelling, practical job demonstrations and real women's experiences.</li>\n            <li>Structuring the content ecosystem around reach, engagement and lead generation.</li>\n            <li>Planning pre-launch, launch and post-launch communication.</li>\n            <li>Developing content calendars for teasers, curiosity-driven posts, carousels, short-form clips and episode releases.</li>\n            <li>Planning platform-specific content distribution across YouTube, Instagram, Facebook, WhatsApp and LinkedIn.</li>\n            <li>Developing a content repurposing approach to extract short-form stories, insights and human-interest clips from full episodes.</li>\n            <li>Planning creator and community amplification to extend the series into relevant audiences and women's networks.</li>\n            <li>Mapping individual episode clips to relevant Aatm Nirbhar, Scooter Rani, Scooty Didi and founder-led social channels.</li>\n        </ul>\n\n        <h3>RESEARCH, EPISODE DEVELOPMENT & SCRIPTWRITING</h3>\n        <ul>\n            <li>Researching job roles, processes and practical information for episode narratives.</li>\n            <li>Writing Hindi scripts, hooks, presenter narration and episode introductions.</li>\n            <li>Structuring job demonstrations and explaining onboarding, registration and work processes.</li>\n            <li>Developing interview questions to explore the experiences, challenges, earnings and journeys of the women featured.</li>\n            <li>Building episode flow, transitions and storytelling to make each profession accessible to viewers.</li>\n        </ul>\n\n        <h3>CONTENT DISTRIBUTION & AMPLIFICATION</h3>\n        <ul>\n            <li>Planning short-form content from the full-length episodes for discovery and audience engagement.</li>\n            <li>Identifying stories around earnings, safety, work experiences and personal journeys for individual clips.</li>\n            <li>Planning community distribution through relevant women's networks and WhatsApp.</li>\n            <li>Exploring creator-led amplification, reactions and conversations around women entering traditionally male-dominated professions.</li>\n            <li>Connecting content distribution with awareness of livelihood and employment opportunities.</li>\n        </ul>\n\n        <p class=\"mwk-role\">\n            My contribution covered content development, research, scripting, campaign and distribution planning, and the structuring of the series into a wider content ecosystem.\n        </p>\n\n    </div>\n\n</div>\n</div>",
