            "summary": ".editorial-project { width: 100%; max-width: 1000px; margin: 25px auto; color: #d0cec9; font-family:&hellip;",
            "content_html": "<div><style>\n.editorial-project {\n    width: 100%;\n    max-width: 1000px;\n    margin: 25px auto;\n    color: #d0cec9;\n    font-family: 'DM Sans', sans-serif;\n    line-height: 1.7;\n}\n.editorial-details {\n    max-width: 900px;\n    margin: 0 auto;\n}\n.editorial-details p {\n    font-size: 15px;\n    margin: 0 0 18px;\n}\n.editorial-details h3 {\n    font-family: 'Google Sans Flex', sans-serif;\n    font-size: 12px;\n    font-weight: 600;\n    letter-spacing: 1.5px;\n    text-transform: uppercase;\n    color: #c8ad82;\n    margin: 32px 0 14px;\n}\n.editorial-list {\n    list-style: none;\n    padding: 0;\n    margin: 0;\n}\n.editorial-list li {\n    padding: 10px 0;\n    border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(200,173,130,0.15);\n    font-size: 14px;\n}\n.editorial-list a {\n    color: #e0ddd7;\n    text-decoration: none;\n    transition: color 0.2s ease;\n}\n.editorial-list a:hover {\n    color: #c8ad82;\n}\n.editorial-note {\n    margin-top: 28px !important;\n    padding-top: 18px;\n    border-top: 1px solid rgba(200,173,130,0.25);\n    color: #aaa69e;\n    font-size: 14px !important;\n}\n@media (max-width: 600px) {\n    .editorial-details {\n        padding: 0 4px;\n    }\n}\n</style>\n\n<div class=\"editorial-project\">\n    <div class=\"editorial-details\">\n\n        <p>\n            A selection of published SEO-oriented editorial articles written for MyMobileIndia and VIPFortunes, covering consumer technology, smartphones, gadgets, digital platforms, gaming, streaming, entertainment and pop culture.\n        </p>\n\n        <p>\n            My work involved researching topics and developing reader-focused articles around technology updates, product developments, practical guides, entertainment stories and trending subjects. The focus was on making information accessible, structuring content for online readership and creating articles suited to their respective audiences.\n        </p>\n\n        <h3>SMARTPHONES, GADGETS & CONSUMER TE