        {
            "id": "https://	kartikayashivomrania.github.io/portfolio/baazi-games-or-newsletters-research-and-copywriting/",
            "url": "https://	kartikayashivomrania.github.io/portfolio/baazi-games-or-newsletters-research-and-copywriting/",
            "title": "Baazi Games | Newsletters – Research &amp; Copywriting",
            "summary": "As part of Baazi Games' newsletter communication, I worked on two editions&hellip;",
            "content_html": "<div class=\"gallery-wrapper gallery-wrapper--wide\"><div class=\"gallery\" data-translation=\"Add images\" data-columns=\"3\" data-is-empty=\"false\">\n<figure class=\"gallery__item\"><a href=\"https://\tkartikayashivomrania.github.io/portfolio/media/posts/37/gallery/BB-News-Letter-1.jpg\" data-size=\"600x2516\"><img loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://\tkartikayashivomrania.github.io/portfolio/media/posts/37/gallery/BB-News-Letter-1-thumbnail.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"600\" height=\"2516\"></a></figure>\n<figure class=\"gallery__item\"><a href=\"https://\tkartikayashivomrania.github.io/portfolio/media/posts/37/gallery/BB-News-Letter-2.png\" data-size=\"600x2258\"><img loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://\tkartikayashivomrania.github.io/portfolio/media/posts/37/gallery/BB-News-Letter-2-thumbnail.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"600\" height=\"2258\"></a></figure>\n</div></div>\n<div class=\"baazi-project\">\n<div class=\"baazi-details\">\n<p>As part of Baazi Games' newsletter communication, I worked on two editions covering company updates, platform developments, brand initiatives and people within the organisation.</p>\n<p>The newsletters brought together updates from different teams and brands, employee stories, product developments and community-focused content. The aim was to turn information from across the organisation into engaging, readable newsletter content.</p>\n<h3>CONTENT HIGHLIGHTS</h3>\n<ul>\n<li>BalleBaazi's fourth anniversary and reflections from team members.</li>\n<li>Company and platform updates, including BalleBaazi 3.0.</li>\n<li>CardBaazi and PokerBaazi updates and initiatives.</li>\n<li>Team stories, employee introductions and personal interests.</li>\n<li>Internal updates and engaging features for the newsletter audience.</li>\n</ul>\n<h3>MY CONTRIBUTION</h3>\n<ul>\n<li>Researching topics and gathering information for newsletter stories.</li>\n<li>Speaking with relevant people to collect details, perspectives and inputs.</li>\n<li>Developing and writing the newsletter content from A to Z.</li>\n<li>Structuring stories, headlines, introductions and individual content sections.</li>\n<li>Editing and refining copy for clarity, flow and readability.</li>\n<li>Working with the designer to discuss the content and its visual presentation.</li>\n</ul>\n<p class=\"baazi-credit\">My responsibility covered research, information gathering and complete written content. Visual design and layout were handled by the designer.</p>\n</div>\n</div>",
