            "title": "Baazi Games | Promotional Emails – Copywriting",
            "summary": "As part of Baazi Games' email communication, I worked on the copywriting&hellip;",
            "content_html": "<div class=\"gallery-wrapper gallery-wrapper--wide\"><div class=\"gallery\" data-translation=\"Add images\" data-columns=\"3\" data-is-empty=\"false\">\n<figure class=\"gallery__item\"><a href=\"https://\tkartikayashivomrania.github.io/portfolio/media/posts/36/gallery/BB-Mail-1.jpg\" data-size=\"590x2697\"><img loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://\tkartikayashivomrania.github.io/portfolio/media/posts/36/gallery/BB-Mail-1-thumbnail.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"590\" height=\"2697\"></a></figure>\n<figure class=\"gallery__item\"><a href=\"https://\tkartikayashivomrania.github.io/portfolio/media/posts/36/gallery/BB-Mail-2.jpg\" data-size=\"620x1926\"><img loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://\tkartikayashivomrania.github.io/portfolio/media/posts/36/gallery/BB-Mail-2-thumbnail.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"620\" height=\"1926\"></a></figure>\n</div></div>\n<div class=\"baazi-project\">\n<div class=\"baazi-details\">\n<p>As part of Baazi Games' email communication, I worked on the copywriting for two promotional emails designed to share company updates, platform developments, brand communication and community-focused stories with the audience.</p>\n<p>The emails covered subjects including BalleBaazi's anniversary, platform updates, developments across Baazi Games' brands, and stories highlighting people and activities within the organisation.</p>\n<h3>MY CONTRIBUTION</h3>\n<ul>\n<li>End-to-end copywriting for both promotional emails.</li>\n<li>Writing and structuring all email content, headlines and section descriptions.</li>\n<li>Organising information into a clear and engaging email flow.</li>\n<li>Refining messaging for readability, tone and audience engagement.</li>\n<li>Discussing the creative execution with the designer to communicate the intended content and presentation.</li>\n</ul>\n<p class=\"baazi-credit\">My contribution was focused on writing and content development. The visual design and artwork were handled by the designer.</p>\n</div>\n</div>",
            "author": {
                "name": "Kartikaya Shiv Omrania"
            },
